Solace's design takes inspiration from, and may adapt portions of, the following projects:

- herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache License 2.0.
  Agent detection rules and Windows ConPTY handling approaches.
- T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 T3 Tools Inc.
  Visual language: dark palette tokens and interface conventions.

- Lobe Icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), MIT License, Copyright (c) LobeHub.
  Agent brand marks in src/shared/icons/agents.

Any file adapted from these projects keeps a header naming its origin.

This product bundles the Windows ConPTY runtime (conpty.dll and OpenConsole.exe) from
Microsoft's Microsoft.Windows.Console.ConPTY package, https://github.com/microsoft/terminal,
licensed under the MIT License. Its license and third-party notices ship in conpty/.
